				<wikidot:authorName>A Random Day</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1841781</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Remove the last two lines in the last tab because they ruin the ending. Olliefox reminds me of Ruiz Duchamp and Pico Wilson in the best ways and his transformation into the fennec fox is just goofy enough to be creepy.</p> <p>But</p> <blockquote> <p>SLAM.</p> <p>Celia duct taped the morgue drawer shut, propped a chair over it, and flipped it the bird for good measure.</p> </blockquote> <p>kills the comedy and the horror dead. It's like the moral appended to an email joke forwarded to you by your grandma.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
